"P2476074862" "The Devouring Earth has contaminated the school lunches with some sort of mutagen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3857274828" "It looks like the Devouring Earth were planning to put some kind of mutagen into those school lunches. Who knows what those children would have become? Every parent in this city owes you a debt today, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P2714764416" "My daughter drew a picture of {HeroName} in school today."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P230824620" "It looks like the Devouring Earth put some kind of mutagen into those school lunches. I know you did your best, but the lunch program will have to be put on hold until the authorities are sure they've disposed of all of the contaminated food. This city just became a much more frightening place to raise children, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P4207758227" "My daughter asked me, if {HeroName} can't protect us, who can? I didn't know what to tell her."

