// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GeologistStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3862906995" "The geologist's story"
// DetailString :
"P2763361926" "When you rescued Dr. Eileen Turner, she told you:<br><br>'They've had me down here for days. They kept ordering me to find the weak points in the cavern walls, so they can plant their bombs. They want to release an underground river and sink the whole city! Millions could perish. I tried to misdirect them, but I honestly believe they could smell my fear. Thank you, {HeroName}, thank you so much!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4281846803" "I heard a strange story from one of my informants. Seems some kids were partying in some caves near Talos Island, when a tired, unkempt woman crawled up from the depths of the cavern. It was Dr. Eileen Turner, the missing geologist. The kids gave her some food, but she said she had to return to the cavern before 'the Devoured' found her missing. She begged the kids to tell someone that the city faced great danger from under the earth. The Devouring Earth are one of the biggest hazards the city, and maybe the world, faces. They already destroyed Woodvale, who knows what they plan on next? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I really need think it would be a good idea for you to check out those caverns.</A> You only have 90 minutes to deal with the situation."
// AcceptString :
"P3346910186" "Check out the caverns"
// SendOffString :
"P2266704311" "Dr. Turner mentioned 'the Devoured.' I'm worried that she might be referring to the horde of nightmarish creatures called 'The Devouring Earth'. No one knows who controls the Devouring Earth's monsters, but who ever they are they have an extremist ecological view and are willing to kill and destroy to achieve it. If Dr. Turner is in their clutches, she has to be rescued and the creatures' plan has to be stopped."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2478034936" "Stop beasts' leader, its guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P278314480" "Have you looked into those caves yet? My contacts tell me Dr. Turner's still missing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2576548344" "You've wandered these twisted caverns for what seems like hours. You only hope you're not walking in circles."

