// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - BigBombs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1332527536" "You have stopped the Devouring Earth's plot to divert an underground river and sink Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2358933039" "The bombs rock the earth, but the river does not divert and sink Paragon City"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P419780474" "If the Devouring Earth had succeeded, they might have sunk a good chunk of the city. It's a good thing you were on top of this one, {HeroName}. Dr. Turner is recovering with relatives out in California, but she asked me to send you her thanks. She says that she thought she'd never see the sun again, until you showed up."
// RandomFameString :
"P2589083708" "My brother is worried about me living here, but with heroes like {HeroName} around, I can't help but feel safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P234868299" "Well, it looks like Dr. Turner got to be the hero this time. The Devoured were trying to divert an underground river that would have sunk a good portion of the city. They were forcing Dr. Turner to position their bombs for them, but she tricked them. It was close, but the bombs didn't do enough damage. As for Dr. Turner, we can only hope she made it out alive."
// RandomFameString :
"P2448941017" "Did you feel the ground shaking the other day?"

