// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2381855277" "The building is in chaos. Security guards are valiantly struggling to get people out of the building, but you know it's up to you to restore order."

