"P2234099343" "You found a copy of the Council's data on the Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2328923435" "You have foiled the Council's plan to use Devouring Earth creatures as weapons."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P440294173" "The Council has tried some pretty nasty plans before, but this was unbelievable! Considering the end result, I don't think we have to worry about them trying it again. Oh, and Congressman Marlowe sends you his thanks for your selfless service to the city and the country. Looks like someone has friends in high places."
// RandomFameString :
"P740583976" "Did you see Congressman Marlowe's speech on TV last night? He mentioned {HeroName} by name!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_DE_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3830785416" "The Devouring Earth are of the most dangerous threats the city faces right now, and without heroes fighting them at every turn they could wreak unimaginable damage and destruction. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Heroes such as your self need to keep the pressure on them by defeating the Devouring Earth's minions at every turn.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3050212204" "Defeat some Devouring Earth monsters"
// SendOffString :
"P3339708404" "The Devouring Earth are trying to extend their reach into several areas. Fighting them anywhere they appear would help. If you're looking for a place to go, I'd recommend that you look in Terra Volta and Talos Island."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1806311919" "Combat Devouring Earth menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1859674447" "I need you to defeat some more Devouring Earth creatures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1438838468" "You have defeated enough Devouring Earth creatures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1825210487" "The Devouring Earth seek to put an end to mankind and all of human civilization. Fighting them is a constant battle, but a battle that needs to be fought."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_DE_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1230061947" "There are a lot of reports from Talos Island about the Devouring Earth trying to establish a foothold in the area. I don't want to see that happen. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to clear them out.</A> Talos fought and died to protect this city, {HeroName}. It would be a tragedy if the zone named after him were to fall to those monsters."
// AcceptString :
"P1699803400" "Go to Talos Island and defeat Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P2737701511" "A lot of the reports are coming from the Eleusis and the Serpent's Teeth, but I'm sure any neighborhood in the zone would welcome your assistance."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1719635451" "Defeat Devouring Earth in Talos"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P723773144" "You need to defeat more Devouring Earth monsters to help keep Talos Island safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P32321475" "You have cleared out enough Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1839271628" "Talos himself would have been proud of your efforts, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_DE_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4036213786" "The Terra Volta reactor has been under constant attack by the Devouring Earth. They see the reactor and its power complex as an affront to nature. Not to mention that the War Walls it powers stop their progress through Paragon City. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like to ask you to lend a hand in the defense of Terra Volta, as many heroes have in the past.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2454752735" "Go to Terra Volta and defeat Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P2726558641" "The Devouring Earth have been spotted around Rogers Industries and Carter Engineering. But you can probably find the monsters anywhere you see ruined buildings."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3488408513" "Defeat Devouring Earth in Terra Volta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3173613229" "Go to Terra Volta and defeat Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3600971824" "You have cleared enough Devouring Earth out of Terra Volta."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1562396148" "Good work in Terra Volta, {HeroName}. Whatever your feelings on nuclear power, Terra Volta is vital to the continued existence of the city. That old reactor probably should be shut down, but right now it's the only thing that can provide power for the War Walls. If the Devouring Earth ever succeeded in destroying it, the chaos would be unimaginable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_DE_Mission2.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_FEMALE_UNKEMPT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_NAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GeologistStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3918963862" "I've got a bad feeling about this one, {HeroName}; I think you should recruit a team. I heard some kids were partying in some caves near Talos Island, when a tired, unkempt woman crawled up from the depths of the cavern. It was Dr. Eileen Turner, the missing geologist. The kids gave her some food, but she said she had to return to the cavern before 'the Devoured' found her missing. She begged the kids to tell someone that the city faced great danger from under the earth. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you should check out those caverns.</A> You only have 90 minutes to deal with the situation. <color orange>And you'll need at least one teammate.</color>"
// SendOffString :
"P2703155616" "It sounds like Dr. Turner is in the clutches of the Devouring Earth. No one knows who's the mastermind behind those monsters' mayhem. But whoever he is, he's willing to kill and destroy to achieve his extremist ecological goals."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4236865904" "Stop beasts' leader & its guards"

